# OSDAI — Phusion Passenger / cPanel Entry Point
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT add a RewriteRule pointing to app.js here.
# That causes Apache to serve app.js as a text file when Passenger is inactive.
#
# Passenger intercepts all requests automatically once configured in
# cPanel → Node.js Selector. The PassengerNodejs path is written there
# by cPanel and should NOT be hardcoded here.
#
# Required cPanel Node.js Selector settings:
#   Node.js version : 22.x (>=22.13 required for pdfjs-dist)
#   Application mode: Production
#   Application root: /home/<user>/public_html/osdai   (or wherever git was cloned)
#   Application URL : osdai.smkn1wonogiri.sch.id
#   Startup file    : app.js

PassengerEnabled on
PassengerStartupFile app.js
PassengerAppType node
PassengerMaxPoolSize 1
PassengerFriendlyErrorPages off
